  displayName: Volt Pylon
  description: Powers the whole camp (Conveyor Hub, Auto-Assembler, Sprinklers, Turrets).
    A Charging kin fills it like a battery, then is free for other work and comes
    back to top it up at half charge and before nightfall. Holds a fifth of a day;
    build Volt Batteries to store more.
